      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "From the light that is Christ, and from Incorruptibility, by the gift of the Spirit, four lights came forth.",
          "es": "De la luz que es Cristo, y de la Incorruptibilidad, por el don del Espíritu, salieron cuatro luces."
        },
        {
          "en": "They came out of the divine Self-Generated, and he wanted them to stand beside him.",
          "es": "Salieron del divino Autoengendrado, y él quiso que estuvieran a su lado."
        },
        {
          "en": "They are four great lights, great beings full of light.",
          "es": "Son cuatro grandes luces, grandes seres llenos de luz."
        },
        {
          "en": "With them are the three: Will, Thought, and Life.",
          "es": "Con ellas están los tres: la Voluntad, el Pensamiento y la Vida."
        },
        {
          "en": "And the four powers: Understanding, Grace, Perception, and Prudence.",
          "es": "Y los cuatro poderes: el Entendimiento, la Gracia, la Percepción y la Prudencia."
        }
      ]
